extends RefCounted
## Run EVENTS (data). The runner lives in run_map.gd (Run agent).
##
## Schema (doc §16):
##   id: {"title", "region": wound|rivers|hollow|archive|any,
##        "teaser" (<= 34 chars, shown on the map),
##        "min_stage", "min_day" (optional gates, both must hold),
##        "see": 2-4 lines (<= 44 chars), "think" (optional, <= 8 words),
##        "hand": true (optional: `see` is your handwriting, pass it through Lore.legible),
##        "options": 2-3 of {"label" (<= 14), "detail" (<= 44, plain stakes),
##            "req" (optional: "reagent" | "colony" | "fray_max" | material name: n),
##            "out": [outcome], "after": line,
##            "chance" (optional 0..1), "else": [outcome], "else_after": line}}
##
## Outcomes used (exactly the §16 set): colony, max_colony, fray, reagent, uptake,
## tissue, booster, primer, lab_reagent, breath, clock, clock_fwd, adapt (id or
## rarity), gene (id or pool), upgrade, upgrade_random, excise, transform, junk,
## fight, text.
## "INFECTION +N%" in a detail means clock_fwd N (100 = one stage).
## "CLOCK -N%" means clock N (pushes the infection back).

